All 15 tests pass. I fixed three bugs in `src/text_utils.py`:

1. **`slugify` didn't lowercase** — added `.lower()` at the end.
2. **`slugify` didn't fully collapse repeated separators** — `replace("--", "-")` only handled one pair; wrapped it in a `while` loop.
3. **`truncate` ignored suffix length** — changed `text[:max_len] + suffix` to `text[:max_len - len(suffix)] + suffix` so the total length respects `max_len`.
